# Flutter Engine old-world LoongArch64 support patch
#
# Apply from the engine checkout root (the directory containing build/ and flutter/):
#   patch -p1 < oldworld-loongarch64-engine.patch
#
# This patch contains source/build-system compatibility changes needed to build
# Flutter Engine on old-world LoongArch64 systems where the toolchain exposes
# loongarch64 with the /lib64/ld.so.1 dynamic linker and no LSX/LASX compiler flags.

